## 3. Intersection of Two Linked Lists – LeetCode #160

**Difficulty:** Easy

**Concept:** Use two pointers. When a pointer reaches the end of one list, move it to the head of the other list. Both pointers eventually meet at the intersection node or at null.

**Time Complexity:** O(m + n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
public class Solution {
    public ListNode getIntersectionNode(ListNode headA, ListNode headB) {
        ListNode a = headA;
        ListNode b = headB;

        while (a != b) {
            a = (a == null) ? headB : a.next;
            b = (b == null) ? headA : b.next;
        }

        return a;
    }
}
```

