## 5. Remove Nth Node From End of List – LeetCode #19

**Difficulty:** Medium

**Concept:** Use two pointers with a gap of n nodes. Move both pointers until the fast pointer reaches the end, then remove the required node.

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
class Solution {
    public ListNode removeNthFromEnd(ListNode head, int n) {
        ListNode dummy = new ListNode(0);
        dummy.next = head;

        ListNode fast = dummy;
        ListNode slow = dummy;

        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {
            fast = fast.next;
        }

        while (fast != null) {
            fast = fast.next;
            slow = slow.next;
        }

        slow.next = slow.next.next;

        return dummy.next;
    }
}
```

